# Core Pipeline

- **Orchestrator** (`src/core/orchestrator.py`)：协调 4 阶段，run() / run_from_stage_2()
- **ExecutionContext** (`src/core/context.py`)：携带 requirements、plan、repository
- **Settings** (`config/settings.py`)：Pydantic-settings，从 .env 加载

数据流：Requirements → EngineeringPlan → CodeRepository → ValidatedProject

需完整数据模型时读 @docs/refs/DATA_MODELS_REF.md
